QuestGuidance.Register("en",291,{
[9281]="7003A692\n1\tDefeat Dunlending Labourers (0/12) Defeat White Hand Warriors (0/8)\tMate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but was conquered by a group of White Hand from Madh-fushaum.\n2\tDefeat Dunlending Labourers (total: 12)\030Defeat White Hand Warriors (total: 8)\tThe Dunlendings, being of the lowest rank, seem responsible for most of the manual labour. The Orc warriors are aiding their efforts or performing guard duty.\n3\tComplete\tThe workers are defeated and the mining operations in Mate Isernore have all but ceased.\n",
[9282]="70046C26\n1\tCollect horsetail seeds (total: 6)\030Collect oxlip seeds (total: 6)\030Collect vetchling seeds (total: 6)\tSeeds can be found on the Field of Cormallen and in the surrounding woods. Ereblen has asked you to gather many seeds from the Field of Cormallen and then plant them in the lowlands of North Ithilien.\n2\tPlant the seeds in fertile soil in North Ithilien (total: 6)\tFertile soil can be found in the lowlands of North Ithilien to the west and south of Henneth Annûn. You have gathered many seeds and should now plant them throughout North Ithilien.\n3\tTalk to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn. You have planted many seeds and should now return to Ereblen.\n",
[9283]="70028C91\n1\tBring the orders to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, north of Brôntrig. You should bring the orders you found to Ardwyn without delay.\n",
[9284]="70036FD1\n1\tTBD\t\n",
[9285]="7004DA73\n1\tDestroy river nets (total: 10)\tRiver nets can be found along the Forest River between Loeglond and Felegoth. An enemy of the North has been using river nets to steal shipments from Felegoth to Loeglond beneath the notice of the Elves. You should destroy the river nets before more shipments are stolen.\n2\tTalk to Lorndúr\tLorndúr can be found in Loeglond. You should talk to Lorndúr.\n",
[9286]="700075B4\n1\tTalk to Gillemin Brandybuck in the Old Forest\tGillemin Brandybuck's camp is a distance to the south-east in the Old Forest, beyond Old Muddyfoot's Hill. Toly Brockhouse asked you to seek the counsel of an old forester named Gillemin Brandybuck.\n",
[9287]="70067EEA\n1\tMake your way through the fort to feed the hungry workers and spread coin to those who have become dispirited with the work and schedules they must maintain.\t\n2\tTell Beliash you did as he asked\tYour work is done. Head back to Beliash in Rakhatâb and let him know what you have done.\n",
[9288]="70044639\n1\tSpeak with Dervorin upon the wall of the Second Circle\tDervorin will meet you upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should climb up on top the wall of the Second Circle to meet with Dervorin.\n2\tLook towards Mount Mindolluin\tDervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should look towards Mount Mindolluin with Dervorin.\n3\tSpeak with Dervorin\tDervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Dervorin.\n",
[9289]="70044647\n1\tLook at the fire\tThe brazier sits next to Rossaran. You should look at the flames.\n2\tSpeak with Rossaran\tRossaran can be found in the Court of Tarondor on the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Rossaran.\n",
[9290]="70046BB0\n1\tTell Morgul lurkers of the King's return (total: 8)\030Defeat Morgul lurkers (total: 4)\tMorgul lurkers can be found in the wooded land south of the after-battle Cross-roads. You should proclaim the King's return to any Morgul Orcs lurking nearby.\n2\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n",
[9291]="70034D80\n1\tTell Cyneberg Iothete's tale\tCyneberg can be found at the refugees' hideout south-west of Dunfast. You should hasten to the refugees' hideout to tell Cyneberg of Iothete's strange encounter, and the stone he hid in his house.\n2\tTell Cyneberg that she must bring the refugees to Forlaw\tCyneberg is at the refugees' hideout. You should tell Cyneberg that she must return to Forlaw with you.\n3\tHasten to Forlaw to tell Gárwig all that you know\tGárwig is in Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw. You should return to Gárwig and tell him everything Iothete told you.\n",
[9292]="700169B8\n1\tTalk to Kúli at the Chittering Hole\tKuli is at the Chittering Hole, south-east of the Orc-watch. Róarr asked you to find Kúli at the Chittering Hole and deliver to him the news of Nykr's death.\n",
[9293]="70032C2C\n1\tTake Knakk's goat to Kúli's camp to speak with him about the locket\tKnakk's goat is standing near Knakk. Knakk's goat can take you safely to Kúli's camp near the grodbog hive in the southern cavern of the Redhorn Lodes. Knakk asked you to find Kúli and deliver to him the news of Kafli's death and ask him to translate the ancient dwarf-text found within the locket.\n",
[9294]="70052B1A\n1\tDeliver Amelina's trinket to Atta\tAtta can be found in Hultvís. You have discovered a trinket bearing the name of Atta's long-deceased sister, Amelina. You should deliver it to Atta at once.\n2\tFind Radagast in Hultvís\tRadagast can be found somewhere in Hultvís. After Radagast came to Hultvís, he spoke to Atta about the Snatcher. Overcome with emotion at the return of his sister's trinket, Atta has vowed to spend his remaining days travelling Middle-earth.\n3\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found standing beside Ríkmar in Hultvís. You have found Radagast in Hultvís and should now speak to him.\n",
[9295]="70017612\n1\tAssist Mallas with his efforts at the Sixteenth Hall\030Assist Mallas with his efforts at Skûmfil\030Assist Throstur with his efforts at Skûmfil\030Assist Gelirwen with her efforts at the Dark Delvings\tMallas, Throstur, and Gelirwen are at the Shadowed Refuge, south-east of the Twenty-first Hall. Veúlfur wants to better understand the enemy appearing from the edges of the shadowy dark. He sent you to the Shadowed Refuge to assist his agents and allies there with various tasks meant to divine the dangers and meanings of the nefarious creature found therein.\n2\tReturn to Veúlfur at the Twenty-first Hall\tVeúlfur is at the Twenty-first hall, north-west of the Shadowed Refuge. You successfully assisted all of Veúlfur's agents at the Shadowed Refuge, earning from them honour and respect.\n",
[9296]="700190EB\n1\tCollect elanor-blossoms (total: 6)\030Collect niphredil-blossoms (total: 6)\tElanor and niphredil can be found upon and around the hill of Cerin Amroth. Tuilinn has asked you to pick elanor and niphredil.\n2\tBring blossoms to Maliriel at the Hythe\030Bring blossoms to Ambendel at Echad Andestel\030Bring blossoms to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, west of Cerin Amroth. Ambendel is in Echad Andestel, south-west of Cerin Amroth. Maliriel is at the Hythe, east and south of Cerin Amroth, by the river. Tuilinn has asked you to bring elanor and niphredil-blossoms each to Bahanneth, Ambendel, and Maliriel the Feast-mistress.\n3\tTalk to Tuilinn at Cerin Amroth\tTuilinn is atop the flet at Cerin Amroth. You should return to Tuilinn and relate to her how her gift lifted the spirits of her friends.\n",
[9297]="7006CE14\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9298]="7006CE15\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9299]="7006CF78\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9300]="7006CF79\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9301]="70018FC2\n1\tPick up a bundle of arrows next to Celegúien\tCelegúien has a bundle of arrows for you to deliver on the crates by her in Echad Andestel. She wants you to carry them to Meredhrandir at the camp of Mekhem-bizru, very near to the entrance to Moria. She advised you to follow the road west and north as it passes through Nanduhirion, and to beware of Orcs on the road. You have been asked to deliver arrows from Echad Andestel to Mekhem-bizru.\n2\tTalk to Meredhrandir\tMeredhrandir is at Mekhem-bizru, right by the eastern entrance to Moria. You have brought a bundle of arrows to Meredhrandir and should speak to him about the journey.\n",
[9302]="70046C3D\n1\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\t\n2\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm can be found among his company on the banks of the Anduin in south-western North Ithilien. You have encountered a familiar party of Variags camped within North Ithilien and should speak to their Jarl.\n3\tMeet Jarl Gurthilm at the Field of Cormallen\tThe Field of Cormallen can be found far to the north in the north-western reaches of North Ithilien. Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to keep the Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien at bay as he and his men travel. He expects a report on your efforts near the Field of Cormallen.\n4\tSearch for Jarl Gurthilm's company near the Field of Cormallen\tJarl Gurthilm and his company must be somewhere nearby the Field of Cormallen. You have arrived at the Field of Cormallen, but the Variags are nowhere to be found. You should search nearby for Jarl Gurthilm's company.\n5\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the east of the Field of Cormallen. You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him.\n",
[9303]="7002BFAD\n1\tTalk to the leader of the Easterlings at their camp in the Rushgore\tThe Easterling camp lies to the south of the Woodman camp in the Rushgore. Amal asked you to speak with the leader of the Easterlings in the Rushgore and convince him that they are not a threat.\n2\tTalk to Amal at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore\tAmal is at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore, north of the Easterling camp. You should return to Amal with Nafrati's warning.\n",
[9304]="70037E74\n1\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. Agelman has asked that you speak to Edric on his behalf about remaining in Entwade to combat the White Hand forces.\n2\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn. Thane Edric has denied Agelman in his request to remain in Entwade and battle alongside the other warriors. You should now speak to Agelman about what is to be done next.\n3\tFind a sword in Entwade\030Find a shield in Entwade\tA sword and shield can be found scattered about Entwade. Agelman has asked that you arm him. He believes a sword can be found near the training dummies, and a shield can be found near the stable-master.\n4\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied with your horn. You have recovered a sword and shield for Agelman at his request, and should now return them to his keeping.\n",
[9305]="70032B96\n1\tDestroy Orc-tents (total: 5)\030Destroy barricades (total: 3)\tOrc tents and barricades can be found in Mudmul-charâf, a passage in north-western Zelem-melek. You should destroy the makeshift dwellings and defences of the Orcs.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed the dwellings and defences of the enemy in Mudmul-charâf.\n",
[9306]="70058FCC\n1\tDefeat goblin-assassins on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 6)\tGundabad goblin-assassins can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân. Goblin-assassins of Gundabad stalk the battlefield around Zudramdân and seek to put an end to unwary dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the goblin-assassins of Gundabad stalking the battlefield around Zudramdân.\n",
[9307]="700272C6\n1\tThe store-houses can be found in the huts and towers throughout the herd-lands, not far from Blodwen's hiding spot. Flaming brands used by the Dragon-clan to conquer the farm are likely near the huts. You should burn down the seed store-houses so that they cannot continue to supply the Dragon-clan.\t\n2\tReturn to Blodwen in the herd-lands\tBlodwen still lingers in her hiding place, waiting for death to reunite her with her new family. You should tell Blodwen that you have destroyed what was left of the farm.\n",
[9308]="70027327\n1\tDefeat toads and scrape residue from their skins (total: 4)\tToads can be found throughout Tâl Methedras, on the far shore of the lake and the island in the middle of the water. Iwan has asked you to collect some of the residue from the skins of toads in Tâl Methedras.\n2\tBring the toad-residue to Iwan\tIwan is sitting on the shore of the lake near the orchard of Tûr Morva. You have collected residue from the toads of Tâl Methedras and should bring it back to Iwan.\n3\tTalk to Maelona in Tûr Morva\tMaelona is outside her house near the entrance of Tûr Morva. Iwan has inadvisably tasted the toad-residue that he wants to coat the Falcon-clan's weapons with and is now sick. He has sent you to the healer Maelona to bring him something that will cure him.\n4\tBring the root-powder to Iwan\tIwan is at the lake's edge near the orchards of Tûr Morva. Maelona has given you some powder that should cure Iwan of his digestive complaint.\n",
[9309]="70040047\n1\tDestroy tents\tTents can be found all over the bandit encampment as the bandits have attempted to set up a comfortable living space for themselves. You should destroy the tents of the bandits who so cruelly wounded and robbed Fuirion.\n2\tDestroy tents (total: 8)\tTents can be found all over the bandit encampment as the bandits have attempted to set up a comfortable living space for themselves. You should destroy the tents of the bandits who so cruelly wounded and robbed Fuirion.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed a number of bandit tents in the encampment.\n",
[9310]="70035206\n1\tTend to the corpses of Byre Tor's men (total: 8)\tDead men lay strewn about the town of Byre Tor. You should put the dead men to rest, for they should not be left out as trophies of the Orcs.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have put many of the former inhabitants of Byre Tor to rest.\n",
[9311]="70058BBB\n1\tFree captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 8)\tCaptured dwarves can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. After receiving word that dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ have been captured and brought to Bagûd-mekhem, Dréri hopes to see them freed before they are slain. You should free captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tTalk to Dréri at Drenghól\tDréri can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have freed a number of captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report your success to Dréri.\n",
[9312]="70037CA7\n1\tDefeat fleeing Orcs near the Entwash (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found to the south of Entwade near the shores of the river Entwash. Thane Edric's guard, Magenred, has asked you to slay Orcs that have fled into Kingstead from the Sutcrofts.\n2\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have defeated the remainder of Orc forces that fled into the Westemnet. You should inform Thane Edric of your success.\n",
})
